WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.050
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.320 --> 01:41.320
[Episode 34]

3
01:52.120 --> 01:57.040
Chang Xuan, tell me, what happened between you and Ping Jun?

4
01:58.620 --> 02:00.120
Ping Jun remembered everything?

5
02:00.120 --> 02:02.973
And what's this in the letter about her mother's death?

6
02:02.973 --> 02:05.019
Didn't you say Auntie Ye died in an accident?

7
02:05.019 --> 02:06.200
Exactly.

8
02:06.200 --> 02:09.640
Ping Jun is pregnant and out there all alone. Where could she even go?

9
02:09.640 --> 02:10.719
You...

10
02:10.719 --> 02:11.780
- Chang Xuan! - Chang Xuan!

11
02:11.780 --> 02:13.593
- Chang Xuan! - Chang Xuan!

12
02:16.120 --> 02:18.480
[Siping Town, Changling County] Excuse me, where's the station exit?

13
02:18.480 --> 02:20.560
- Over there. - Thank you.

14
02:20.560 --> 02:21.960
Excuse me.

15
02:21.960 --> 02:24.221
One ticket, next train to Tianjin.

16
02:24.221 --> 02:26.630
The last one just left. No more trains.

17
02:26.630 --> 02:28.840
Martial law starts tomorrow. All lines are suspended.

18
02:28.840 --> 02:31.460
When will they run again? Who knows.

19
02:33.879 --> 02:34.979
Thanks.

20
02:50.800 --> 02:53.800
Hey there, little lady. All by yourself?

21
02:53.800 --> 02:55.319
Where are you headed?

22
02:55.319 --> 02:56.479
No trains, right?

23
02:56.479 --> 02:58.659
We've got a car. Come with us.

24
02:58.659 --> 03:01.259
I'll take you wherever you want.

25
03:01.259 --> 03:03.160
Don't go, miss.

26
03:03.160 --> 03:05.779
Come, have a little fun with us.

27
03:06.800 --> 03:07.979
Let go of me!

28
03:10.800 --> 03:14.060
I'm warning you, there are military police patrolling around here.

29
03:14.060 --> 03:15.740
I'll scream for help!

30
03:16.560 --> 03:17.699
Military police?

31
03:17.699 --> 03:20.719
Sweetheart, I'm the military police you need.

32
03:20.719 --> 03:22.360
Report it right here in my arms.

33
03:22.360 --> 03:23.800
Let go!

34
03:23.800 --> 03:25.080
Let go of me!

35
03:44.480 --> 03:46.699
Wen Bo, look.

36
03:46.699 --> 03:49.560
What are you doing? Stop!

37
03:53.020 --> 03:54.360
Ping Jun?

38
03:58.680 --> 03:59.960
Ping Jun.

39
03:59.960 --> 04:01.760
Ping Jun? What's she doing here?

40
04:01.760 --> 04:03.259
Get her to the hospital. Now!

41
04:03.259 --> 04:04.259
Right.

42
04:13.040 --> 04:14.120
Chang Xuan.

43
04:14.120 --> 04:15.520
What have you got?

44
04:15.520 --> 04:19.730
A rickshaw puller says he picked up a woman who looked a lot like Lady Ping Jun.

45
04:19.730 --> 04:22.120
She got off at the South Gate.

46
04:22.120 --> 04:26.299
We sent a team to follow up in that direction, but nothing so far.

47
04:27.280 --> 04:28.706
Not a single lead?

48
04:29.400 --> 04:32.259
We've set up strict checkpoints at the stations and docks.

49
04:32.259 --> 04:34.939
If we find anything, we'll report immediately.

50
04:38.879 --> 04:40.100
Widen the search.

51
04:40.100 --> 04:42.040
Don't rule anything out.

52
04:42.040 --> 04:44.200
If you get any word on her, tell me at once.

53
04:44.200 --> 04:47.250
And remember, her safety comes first.

54
04:47.250 --> 04:50.439
If she doesn't want to come back, don't force her.

55
04:50.439 --> 04:51.540
Don't worry.

56
04:51.540 --> 04:52.920
I'll get on it.

57
04:58.240 --> 05:00.040
And don't work yourself up.

58
05:00.040 --> 05:01.540
Take care of yourself.

59
05:03.360 --> 05:04.420
Go.

60
05:43.699 --> 05:47.260
Ping Jun, you're awake?

61
05:48.939 --> 05:50.406
Han Zhi?

62
05:53.400 --> 05:55.233
What are you doing here?

63
05:56.120 --> 06:00.055
I was setting up a charity organization in nearby Siping Town.

64
06:00.055 --> 06:03.899
I never expected to run into you on the street last night,

65
06:03.899 --> 06:05.800
so I brought you to the hospital.

66
06:07.339 --> 06:08.699
The hospital?

67
06:15.399 --> 06:16.853
Let go of me!

68
06:21.779 --> 06:23.066
Baby.

69
06:27.459 --> 06:29.166
My baby...

70
06:32.139 --> 06:33.399
My baby...

71
06:34.720 --> 06:36.413
How's my baby?

72
06:44.699 --> 06:47.800
Ping Jun, listen to me.

73
06:49.000 --> 06:51.259
You lost a lot of blood.

74
06:51.259 --> 06:53.699
The doctors did everything they could.

75
06:53.699 --> 06:57.879
The baby... we lost the baby.

76
07:11.560 --> 07:12.899
That's impossible.

77
07:15.240 --> 07:17.019
It's still here.

78
07:19.259 --> 07:21.779
I know it's still here.

79
07:23.899 --> 07:25.460
It's still here.

80
07:26.639 --> 07:28.833
- Still here. - Don't be like this.

81
07:31.360 --> 07:32.560
What are you doing?

82
07:32.560 --> 07:34.339
- I want to see the doctor. - Don't do this.

83
07:34.339 --> 07:35.620
- I want to see the doctor. - Ping Jun!

84
07:35.620 --> 07:37.360
Let go! Where's the doctor?

85
07:37.360 --> 07:40.460
- Calm down. Calm down. Don't be like this. - Doctor!

86
08:20.920 --> 08:22.259
Chang Xuan,

87
08:22.259 --> 08:24.560
I've found something else about the fire that year.

88
08:26.760 --> 08:29.160
One item from the scene was a charred button.

89
08:29.160 --> 08:31.639
Not sure if it matches the one Lady Ping Jun left behind.

90
08:40.960 --> 08:43.580
Probably dropped by one of our own men while fighting the fire.

91
08:50.399 --> 08:52.080
However, there's another possibility.

92
08:57.160 --> 09:00.400
Director, there's quite a stir coming from the Yu family.

93
09:00.400 --> 09:02.080
It's Yu Chang Xuan's men.

94
09:02.080 --> 09:04.379
They've turned almost all of Nanhuai City upside down.

95
09:04.379 --> 09:08.399
They've got checkpoints at the bus station, the train station, every dock and wharf.

96
09:08.399 --> 09:09.700
They're looking for someone.

97
09:11.160 --> 09:12.680
Looking for someone?

98
09:12.680 --> 09:13.880
Yes.

99
09:13.880 --> 09:17.600
They're looking for Yu Chang Xuan's wife.

100
09:17.600 --> 09:20.160
Word is she just up and left home.

101
09:31.179 --> 09:32.700
She remembered.

102
09:34.320 --> 09:36.120
She must have.

103
09:36.899 --> 09:40.379
Remembered what, Director?

104
09:41.560 --> 09:43.217
Send men out at once.

105
09:43.217 --> 09:45.298
We have to find her before Yu Chang Xuan does.

106
09:46.040 --> 09:49.240
Yes, Director. I'll get right on it.

107
09:56.840 --> 09:58.420
Yu Chang Xuan,

108
09:59.560 --> 10:01.461
I knew all along.

109
10:03.360 --> 10:06.140
Whatever you gained through lies,

110
10:06.840 --> 10:09.059
you'll have to give back sooner or later.

111
10:11.040 --> 10:13.461
Once Ping Jun learns the truth,

112
10:14.640 --> 10:19.280
why would she ever want to live under the same roof as you?

113
11:39.760 --> 11:41.000
Ping Jun.

114
11:44.960 --> 11:46.940
Where are you?

115
11:57.520 --> 12:00.120
In the spring and summer of 1927,

116
12:00.120 --> 12:03.139
the Revolutionary Army took city after city and approached Beijing and Tianjin.

117
12:03.139 --> 12:06.840
The Central Government suffered military setbacks, and morale within was shaken.

118
12:06.840 --> 12:09.700
Marshal Xu set up a Northern Military Government

119
12:09.700 --> 12:13.179
in an attempt to unite the northern warlords for a last stand,

120
12:13.179 --> 12:15.399
while quietly letting the Japanese envoy

121
12:15.399 --> 12:17.848
[Temporarily Closed] send peace overtures to the South

122
12:17.848 --> 12:19.740
in hopes of buying time.

123
12:19.740 --> 12:21.059
Under years of war,

124
12:21.059 --> 12:26.159
prices soared, the people struggled to survive, and countless civilians were displaced.

125
12:26.159 --> 12:28.580
Patriots took to the streets,

126
12:28.580 --> 12:32.120
shouting "Down with the warlords! Stop the civil war!"

127
12:32.120 --> 12:34.520
Only to be brutally suppressed.

128
12:34.520 --> 12:39.201
As you all know, the situation is tense.

129
12:40.240 --> 12:45.360
The Central Government is pressing us to pick a side.

130
12:46.360 --> 12:49.039
I want to hear from each of you first.

131
12:52.460 --> 12:55.759
If you ask me, we don't take sides at all.

132
12:55.759 --> 12:58.679
We hold our ground here in Nanhuai.

133
12:58.679 --> 13:01.399
Keeping this region safe and its people secure is what matters most.

134
13:02.480 --> 13:04.480
Xiao Xian makes a good point.

135
13:04.480 --> 13:06.700
But the situation is delicate.

136
13:06.700 --> 13:12.120
If we refuse the Central Government outright, we could become a target for everyone.

137
13:14.259 --> 13:15.399
Chang Xuan.

138
13:17.280 --> 13:19.360
With enemies closing in on all sides,

139
13:19.360 --> 13:23.320
if we blindly follow the Central Government and turn our guns on our fellow countrymen,

140
13:23.320 --> 13:26.820
we'll make an enemy of the South and lose the people's support.

141
13:27.820 --> 13:29.440
I agree with Chang Xuan.

142
13:30.340 --> 13:34.519
But we have to take Chu Wen Fu's meeting in Changling seriously.

143
13:34.519 --> 13:39.100
Someone has to step in and mediate so we can buy our army more time to prepare.

144
13:41.400 --> 13:43.400
Good. It's settled then.

145
13:44.419 --> 13:46.839
Then that's that. Make sure it's delivered then.

146
13:50.680 --> 13:51.739
Chang Xuan.

147
13:52.960 --> 13:54.920
Word from the front at Siping.

148
13:54.920 --> 14:00.510
Someone in the city spotted a figure who looked a little like Lady Ping Jun.

149
14:00.510 --> 14:02.220
But the crowd surged, and they lost her.

150
14:02.220 --> 14:03.940
They can't confirm it yet.

151
14:03.940 --> 14:05.279
Siping?

152
14:08.000 --> 14:09.139
Get the car ready.

153
14:10.159 --> 14:13.600
Chang Xuan, the army's in a tight spot right now.

154
14:13.600 --> 14:14.840
Plenty of eyes are on you.

155
14:14.840 --> 14:17.946
This isn't the time for you to leave Nanhuai.

156
14:18.559 --> 14:22.679
Besides, Lady Ping Jun left with the wrong idea about you.

157
14:22.679 --> 14:26.139
If you show up now, she'd only run farther.

158
14:29.360 --> 14:30.701
Don't worry, Chang Xuan.

159
14:31.360 --> 14:33.440
You have my word. I'll bring her back.

160
14:34.960 --> 14:36.913
Then I'm leaving it to you, Rui Tong.

161
14:47.920 --> 14:50.600
[Jiaqi Florist]

162
15:00.179 --> 15:02.460
- Let's go pick some flowers. - Hello.

163
15:05.040 --> 15:07.880
Miss, we're having a look around.

164
15:07.880 --> 15:09.099
Sure.

165
15:09.820 --> 15:11.620
Come on, sweetie.

166
15:18.220 --> 15:19.846
Is this one pretty?

167
15:29.639 --> 15:30.720
Look.

168
15:32.620 --> 15:34.460
Miss, how much is this?

169
15:35.299 --> 15:38.920
This one's on me.

170
15:38.920 --> 15:40.600
I couldn't possibly.

171
15:40.600 --> 15:41.853
Thank you.

172
15:42.580 --> 15:44.826
She's so nice, isn't she?

173
15:54.679 --> 15:55.840
Let me take over here.

174
15:55.840 --> 15:57.759
Go get that wound bandaged.

175
15:58.840 --> 16:01.299
Just a little prick. It'll be fine.

176
16:02.240 --> 16:07.520
Your child would want to see you doing well.

177
16:07.520 --> 16:11.493
That's the greatest comfort you could give them.

178
16:15.240 --> 16:16.653
I understand.

179
16:17.299 --> 16:19.740
Director, one more thing.

180
16:19.740 --> 16:23.000
With so many people coming and going for this meeting,

181
16:23.000 --> 16:25.440
and the Interior Ministry controlling information,

182
16:25.440 --> 16:26.919
we followed the usual practice

183
16:26.919 --> 16:31.460
and collected review fees from several news agencies and newspapers.

184
16:31.460 --> 16:32.960
Please take a look.

185
16:50.040 --> 16:53.440
Where did you pick up these dirty little tricks?

186
16:53.440 --> 16:54.799
Please forgive me, Director.

187
16:54.799 --> 16:58.919
This money is customary. I was going to...

188
16:58.919 --> 17:00.259
To win me over?

189
17:02.200 --> 17:07.353
You think a small payoff like this can buy me?

190
17:13.560 --> 17:15.480
Spare me, Director!

191
17:15.480 --> 17:18.059
You good-for-nothing. Get out!

192
17:29.579 --> 17:31.593
Such a temper.

193
17:33.259 --> 17:36.859
Director Jiang, you weren't punishing him for corruption.

194
17:36.859 --> 17:39.680
Ye Ping Jun has vanished without a word.

195
17:39.680 --> 17:44.210
You're frantic, so you're taking it out on them.

196
17:44.210 --> 17:48.230
I don't need your advice on my affairs.

197
17:54.440 --> 17:55.660
Let me ask you.

198
17:55.660 --> 17:59.859
You're going to such lengths against Yu Chang Xuan.

199
17:59.859 --> 18:04.440
Is it to get revenge on the Yu family and Yu Chang Xuan,

200
18:04.440 --> 18:10.173
or... to win Ye Ping Jun back?

201
18:12.500 --> 18:16.319
Miss Tao, I think you've forgotten

202
18:16.319 --> 18:20.080
that ours is a partnership of mutual convenience,

203
18:21.640 --> 18:25.240
not some devoted engaged couple,

204
18:28.359 --> 18:32.559
and that you have no right to comment on my feelings.

205
18:36.519 --> 18:38.380
Jiang Xue Ting,

206
18:38.380 --> 18:43.039
you rose fast in the government and locked down your position.

207
18:43.039 --> 18:48.380
That's thanks to the Tang family's money smoothing the way.

208
18:48.380 --> 18:50.319
I'm warning you,

209
18:50.319 --> 18:55.599
don't let your personal feelings ruin all our plans.

210
18:56.900 --> 19:01.019
I will do what I promised,

211
19:02.360 --> 19:06.281
but my personal affairs are none of your business.

212
19:08.339 --> 19:10.000
They'd better not be.

213
19:19.920 --> 19:22.240
- Director Gu, we didn't find her. - Split up and search the alleys up ahead.

214
19:22.240 --> 19:23.379
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

215
19:56.015 --> 19:58.015
[Blossoms of Kindness]

216
19:59.280 --> 20:02.619
Excuse me, where did these plantain lilies come from?

217
20:02.619 --> 20:06.140
Sir, I bought these flowers.

218
20:06.140 --> 20:08.380
- Where? - Two streets up.

219
20:08.380 --> 20:10.099
There's a new flower shop.

220
20:10.099 --> 20:12.224
The owner loves plantain lilies.

221
20:12.224 --> 20:13.420
She's very kind-hearted.

222
20:13.420 --> 20:15.839
She runs charity sales to help the poor.

223
20:15.839 --> 20:18.020
These came from her shop.

224
20:22.099 --> 20:23.799
Please come again.

225
20:52.700 --> 20:53.839
Hello.

226
20:58.839 --> 21:00.039
Ping Jun.

227
21:06.760 --> 21:08.099
How are you doing lately?

228
21:26.200 --> 21:27.440
Ping Jun.

229
21:35.720 --> 21:37.540
It was an accident.

230
21:38.480 --> 21:40.259
I...

231
21:43.000 --> 21:44.500
I lost the baby.

232
21:51.920 --> 21:54.720
Maybe that's how it is with Yu Chang Xuan and me.

233
21:56.040 --> 22:00.740
Our time together is over.

234
22:02.040 --> 22:06.160
Ping Jun, there must be some mistake.

235
22:06.160 --> 22:08.360
Chang Xuan would never hurt your mother.

236
22:08.360 --> 22:10.799
You know how he feels about you.

237
22:10.799 --> 22:14.640
How could he ever hurt the person you love most in this world? How would he dare?

238
22:14.640 --> 22:16.019
It's impossible.

239
22:19.400 --> 22:23.420
I never doubted how he felt about me.

240
22:24.119 --> 22:29.920
But I remember everything now.

241
22:29.920 --> 22:32.539
All this time, I've been thinking.

242
22:33.920 --> 22:37.420
If it weren't for the history between us,

243
22:37.420 --> 22:39.380
my mother would still be alive.

244
22:40.380 --> 22:46.019
Now my mother's gone, and the baby's gone.

245
22:47.539 --> 22:52.079
It's time all of this ended.

246
22:52.079 --> 22:54.180
But he is really worried about you.

247
22:54.180 --> 22:57.220
He's been up every night looking for you.

248
22:57.220 --> 22:58.660
He's afraid you're alone and pregnant,

249
22:58.660 --> 23:01.380
that you're suffering and can't take care of yourself.

250
23:02.220 --> 23:03.440
Ping Jun,

251
23:04.279 --> 23:05.740
come back with me.

252
23:13.040 --> 23:14.341
Director Gu.

253
23:16.160 --> 23:18.839
Could you pretend you never saw me?

254
23:27.460 --> 23:28.720
I'm sorry.

255
23:31.240 --> 23:32.986
I can't lie to Chang Xuan.

256
23:42.319 --> 23:46.039
I only want to continue this quiet life.

257
23:51.140 --> 23:53.080
I'm begging you.

258
24:15.200 --> 24:17.699
Did you find her?

259
24:17.699 --> 24:18.880
I've checked it out.

260
24:20.640 --> 24:22.059
It was a false lead.

261
24:59.560 --> 25:00.880
Ping Jun.

262
25:05.440 --> 25:07.779
Where are you?

263
25:41.360 --> 25:46.340
[Changling County]

264
25:47.119 --> 25:52.480
Generals, the Revolutionary Army in the South is sweeping all before it.

265
25:52.480 --> 25:56.400
Marshal Xu has ordered us to set aside old grievances

266
25:56.400 --> 25:59.559
and build a National Security Army to fight as one.

267
26:00.160 --> 26:02.886
But an allied force like this demands unity from top to bottom.

268
26:03.520 --> 26:04.826
Right now,

269
26:06.160 --> 26:10.513
the Yu family has the strongest troops and the best equipment.

270
26:11.099 --> 26:14.099
In my view, to show our resolve,

271
26:14.099 --> 26:17.259
the Yu family should set an example

272
26:17.259 --> 26:19.859
and place its strongest unit, the 9th Corps,

273
26:19.859 --> 26:23.579
under unified allied command.

274
26:23.579 --> 26:25.560
- How is that possible? - Is he kidding?

275
26:26.440 --> 26:28.720
The Yu family would never agree to that.

276
26:31.039 --> 26:34.480
Demanding the Yu family's finest, the 9th Corps?

277
26:34.480 --> 26:36.400
That's bold.

278
26:36.400 --> 26:38.059
But I'd like to know...

279
26:38.059 --> 26:42.880
Is this the Central Government's idea, or Director Jiang's own?

280
26:46.480 --> 26:49.279
You won't answer.

281
26:49.279 --> 26:52.440
Is that because you don't want to obey the Central Government,

282
26:52.440 --> 26:55.420
or because you have something else in mind?

283
27:03.800 --> 27:09.760
The Yu family is willing to put the 9th Corps into the allied force.

284
27:19.280 --> 27:23.173
However, if there is to be a unified command,

285
27:23.880 --> 27:26.420
then we need a commander-in-chief everyone can accept.

286
27:27.400 --> 27:31.779
I propose the entire allied force be placed under the Yu family's command.

287
27:31.779 --> 27:33.120
What do you say?

288
27:33.120 --> 27:36.000
- That's impossible! - Under their command?

289
27:36.000 --> 27:41.100
- This is no joke. - Put him in command? Can't be serious.

290
27:42.960 --> 27:44.446
Deputy Commander Yu,

291
27:46.640 --> 27:48.859
the Central Government has always placed great trust in you.

292
27:48.859 --> 27:51.839
But today, with the nation in crisis,

293
27:51.839 --> 27:54.280
the Central Government orders you to commit your troops,

294
27:54.280 --> 27:59.240
and yet you want to skip over everyone and take command of all the units.

295
27:59.240 --> 28:03.840
Are you trying to bargain with the Central Government?

296
28:08.920 --> 28:10.140
Chang Xuan,

297
28:11.400 --> 28:14.900
the commander-in-chief of the allied forces is a heavy responsibility.

298
28:14.900 --> 28:18.839
It should go to someone with prestige and seniority.

299
28:19.520 --> 28:24.720
It's good that you have such ambition, and the elders here won't hold it against you.

300
28:27.840 --> 28:32.206
You all know troops fight best under commanders they know.

301
28:33.800 --> 28:39.306
Only the Yu family's officers truly understand the 9th Corps' tactics and deployments.

302
28:40.220 --> 28:43.940
If I hand them over to commanders they don't know,

303
28:43.940 --> 28:50.299
and our brothers die for nothing on the battlefield because of poor coordination...

304
28:50.299 --> 28:52.000
I'm sorry, I can't do that.

305
28:52.000 --> 28:53.320
That makes sense.

306
28:53.320 --> 28:56.619
Changing commanders right before a battle is asking for trouble.

307
28:56.619 --> 28:57.819
Exactly.

308
28:57.819 --> 29:01.140
If it were me, I wouldn't agree either.

309
29:01.140 --> 29:04.913
If they don't even know each other, how are they supposed to fight?

310
29:07.079 --> 29:10.080
The Yu family's position is clear.

311
29:10.080 --> 29:11.193
Good day, generals.

312
29:19.259 --> 29:22.606
The meeting isn't over.

313
29:23.840 --> 29:26.400
Deputy Commander Yu, you're leaving now?

314
29:27.099 --> 29:32.693
Aren't you afraid people will say you're a coward, just looking out for yourself?

315
29:36.080 --> 29:41.120
I was put in charge of troop deployment to prevent any unnecessary misunderstanding

316
29:41.120 --> 29:46.099
between the Central Government and Deputy Commander Yu.

317
29:46.099 --> 29:48.160
If you walk out now,

318
29:48.160 --> 29:53.561
the consequences are more than you can handle.

319
29:59.280 --> 30:05.560
Director Jiang, you're a master at twisting words with a pen.

320
30:05.560 --> 30:07.420
No one does it better.

321
30:07.420 --> 30:08.740
However,

322
30:09.400 --> 30:15.840
those of us who've come through hails of bullets and seas of fire are a different breed.

323
30:15.840 --> 30:19.640
We don't gamble with our brothers' lives.

324
30:19.640 --> 30:22.980
And if anyone tries to use this to move against the Yu Army,

325
30:24.119 --> 30:26.500
the Central Government won't just swallow it.

326
30:31.180 --> 30:34.480
Generals, by all means, continue.

327
30:34.480 --> 30:37.839
Send word to me when you've come to an agreement.

328
30:37.839 --> 30:40.059
The Yu Army has plenty of business to attend to.

329
30:40.059 --> 30:41.980
I won't waste any more of your time.

330
30:55.859 --> 30:57.539
Fresh out of the steamer! Take a look!

331
31:00.140 --> 31:01.720
Hot, fresh buns!

332
31:54.660 --> 31:57.839
Miss Ye, the flowers Mr. Zhang's family ordered are here.

333
31:57.839 --> 31:59.680
Just leave them there. I'll deliver them later.

334
31:59.680 --> 32:00.680
Alright.

335
32:17.840 --> 32:21.560
[Small efforts add up, and our nation stands united.]

336
32:27.700 --> 32:29.519
Fresh flowers!

337
32:30.240 --> 32:31.319
This one. Isn't it nice?

338
32:31.319 --> 32:33.033
- Meat buns! - Take your pick.

339
32:35.360 --> 32:36.953
Pick whichever you like.

340
32:38.759 --> 32:41.400
All right, I'll wrap them up.

341
32:41.400 --> 32:43.839
Director Liang, Han Zhi?

342
32:43.839 --> 32:45.319
What are you two doing together?

343
32:45.319 --> 32:46.480
Don't let them get away!

344
32:46.480 --> 32:48.900
- Move! - You...

345
32:54.240 --> 32:55.986
Don't let them get away!

346
32:56.840 --> 32:58.773
Hurry, they're right ahead!

347
33:03.280 --> 33:04.940
My flowers!

348
33:04.940 --> 33:06.799
Watch where you're going!

349
33:06.799 --> 33:10.760
I'm asking you, did you see three people run past here just now?

350
33:10.760 --> 33:13.300
A man and a woman, supporting another injured woman.

351
33:13.960 --> 33:16.660
If you saw them, you'd better come clean. They are Communists.

352
33:18.940 --> 33:20.320
Three people?

353
33:20.320 --> 33:22.559
I remember now. Yes, there were three.

354
33:22.559 --> 33:24.200
They were running pretty fast.

355
33:24.200 --> 33:25.259
Which way did they go?

356
33:25.259 --> 33:28.030
I think they went that way.

357
33:28.030 --> 33:29.460
Toward the alley entrance.

358
33:29.460 --> 33:30.460
After them!

359
33:32.720 --> 33:33.820
Out of the way!

360
33:45.720 --> 33:49.880
After I left Nanhuai, I studied medicine in Guangzhou.

361
33:49.880 --> 33:52.773
My only thought was to heal people.

362
33:53.400 --> 33:57.200
At a hometown association gathering, I ran into Wen Bo and his friends.

363
33:57.200 --> 34:02.019
By then he had gone from staging modern drama to making patriotic films.

364
34:02.019 --> 34:07.079
At first, I wanted to heal people's bodies, and he wanted to heal their minds.

365
34:08.360 --> 34:13.316
But then we realized this country itself was sick.

366
34:13.316 --> 34:15.720
You can heal a human's body,

367
34:15.720 --> 34:17.930
yet they'll still starve to death in the street.

368
34:17.930 --> 34:19.920
You can wake a human's mind,

369
34:19.920 --> 34:23.204
yet they'll still be gunned down by foreign powers and warlords.

370
34:23.204 --> 34:25.007
Both are treating the symptoms.

371
34:25.007 --> 34:27.707
Neither can change a world where people can barely survive.

372
34:28.659 --> 34:35.340
Ping Jun, our organization wants to wake more people up for good,

373
34:35.340 --> 34:38.980
so they stop being numb, stop letting themselves be trampled on,

374
34:38.980 --> 34:42.880
and work together to find a real path to rebirth

375
34:42.880 --> 34:45.160
for our country and for the whole Chinese nation.

376
34:48.640 --> 34:51.380
I'm sorry, Ping Jun.

377
34:51.380 --> 34:53.340
We kept it from you

378
34:53.340 --> 34:57.840
because what we're doing is too dangerous right now.

379
34:57.840 --> 35:02.340
Given who you are, we didn't want to drag you into this blindly.

380
35:02.340 --> 35:06.579
Han Zhi, why are you apologizing to me?

381
35:06.579 --> 35:08.380
In a world like this,

382
35:08.380 --> 35:13.599
waking people up and trying to save them sounds easy,

383
35:13.599 --> 35:15.639
but it's incredibly hard to do,

384
35:15.639 --> 35:18.280
yet you're willing to stand up and put yourselves on the line.

385
35:18.280 --> 35:21.639
I truly admire that courage.

386
35:21.639 --> 35:25.579
I know there's only so much I can do,

387
35:25.579 --> 35:29.880
but if there's ever anything I can help with,

388
35:29.880 --> 35:32.801
please let me do my part.

389
35:50.940 --> 35:52.119
How did it go?

390
35:52.119 --> 35:54.119
I've got everything you asked for covered.

391
35:54.119 --> 35:57.119
Every day I have different people order flowers. She won't find out.

392
35:57.119 --> 35:59.180
Well done.

393
36:01.760 --> 36:03.061
Good work.

394
36:19.639 --> 36:20.880
Greetings, Deputy Commander.

395
36:37.400 --> 36:38.559
Chang Xuan.

396
36:38.559 --> 36:41.719
In today's drill, the 3rd Regiment of the 9th Corps ran group combat exercises,

397
36:41.719 --> 36:46.019
focusing on bayonet charge techniques and holding formation during the charge.

398
36:51.840 --> 36:57.800
I hear you've got a lady friend in Siping.

399
37:00.659 --> 37:05.119
What, are you keeping secrets from me now?

400
37:08.539 --> 37:14.446
Who's the owner of that flower shop?

401
37:23.699 --> 37:24.820
Lady Ping Jun.

402
37:27.659 --> 37:29.639
She's running that flower shop.

403
37:30.680 --> 37:33.119
Why didn't you tell me? Why didn't you tell me?!

404
37:33.119 --> 37:35.319
I asked you so many times!

405
37:38.199 --> 37:39.739
How is she now?

406
37:44.000 --> 37:45.139
She...

407
37:49.019 --> 37:50.380
She lost the baby.

408
37:57.120 --> 37:58.620
The baby is gone?

409
38:17.760 --> 38:22.820
Rui Tong, we grew up together.

410
38:24.260 --> 38:29.766
Even in the fiercest fighting, I'd trust you with my back.

411
38:35.080 --> 38:37.460
You're the person I trust most.

412
38:41.960 --> 38:44.039
But you knew I was looking for Ping Jun.

413
38:44.039 --> 38:45.380
She's my wife.

414
38:45.380 --> 38:46.579
That was my child.

415
38:46.579 --> 38:48.039
Why did you hide it from me?

416
38:48.039 --> 38:49.260
How could you...

417
38:49.260 --> 38:51.260
How dare you!

418
39:15.440 --> 39:18.139
I failed the trust you placed in me, Chang Xuan.

419
39:18.139 --> 39:20.920
I concealed it and didn't report it. That's unforgivable.

420
39:22.800 --> 39:25.059
Please punish me according to military law.

421
39:26.300 --> 39:28.866
I'll accept it.

422
40:30.579 --> 40:32.519
You think I don't know how you feel about her?

423
40:38.560 --> 40:41.361
If I'd known you'd turn out like this,

424
40:42.160 --> 40:47.247
maybe I would've found the courage back then to talk Chang Xuan into letting you go.

425
41:10.880 --> 41:12.679
It's all my fault,

426
41:13.760 --> 41:19.119
but I've never stepped out of line, nor did I ever intend to betray you.

427
41:27.440 --> 41:29.520
She doesn't want to come back with you, does she?

428
41:36.000 --> 41:41.720
She said she wanted to leave the past behind

429
41:41.720 --> 41:44.099
and doesn't want anyone disturbing her again.

430
41:49.600 --> 41:54.280
Some things just aren't meant to be.

431
41:55.120 --> 41:57.120
Once you know that, you let them go.

432
41:58.640 --> 42:02.040
Your loyalty and your sense of duty

433
42:03.159 --> 42:05.980
won't let you step out of line,

434
42:08.240 --> 42:09.541
and if you do,

435
42:12.160 --> 42:14.133
you're the only one who gets hurt.

436
42:49.640 --> 42:53.233
[Jiaqi Florist]

437
44:07.600 --> 44:09.640
I know what you're going to say,

438
44:11.199 --> 44:12.920
but Yu Chang Xuan,

439
44:16.340 --> 44:18.220
I'm not going back with you.

440
44:19.820 --> 44:22.000
I won't admit to things I didn't do,

441
44:24.820 --> 44:30.320
but I want to clear things up between us.

442
44:32.260 --> 44:37.400
Have you ever thought that maybe, from the very beginning,

443
44:38.679 --> 44:43.393
we were never meant to make it to the end together?

444
44:54.320 --> 44:55.980
I've never believed in fate,

445
44:57.900 --> 44:59.599
and I'm not about to start.

446
45:01.840 --> 45:03.679
I don't want to believe it either.

447
45:04.679 --> 45:09.400
But after everything that's happened, I have no choice.

448
45:10.760 --> 45:15.079
There's always too much standing between us.

449
45:16.079 --> 45:20.780
Every time we get close, fate pushes us apart,

450
45:20.780 --> 45:27.593
as if we were two people from different worlds being forced together.

451
45:40.520 --> 45:43.201
So you won't give me even one chance?

452
45:48.260 --> 45:52.219
Lately, I've been thinking.

453
45:53.980 --> 45:56.460
In this short life,

454
45:56.460 --> 46:00.320
people are trapped by love.

455
46:01.280 --> 46:04.099
All the old love and hate, all the tangled feelings,

456
46:04.099 --> 46:07.079
can drain a person of every last bit of joy and sorrow.

457
46:08.099 --> 46:11.199
Now that I've moved on,

458
46:12.079 --> 46:13.960
I've suddenly realized

459
46:16.260 --> 46:18.760
that in times like these,

460
46:18.760 --> 46:20.780
with the country in turmoil,

461
46:21.679 --> 46:23.900
no matter how painful it is,

462
46:23.900 --> 46:26.780
it's all just small, personal sorrows and joys.

463
46:27.520 --> 46:31.400
I don't want to keep agonizing over whether someone loves me,

464
46:32.199 --> 46:36.179
or how I should hate someone.

465
46:41.860 --> 46:43.719
Instead of being Lady Ping Jun,

466
46:44.400 --> 46:49.820
I'd rather step out and do something that matters more.

467
46:52.400 --> 46:56.460
There's more than one choice in this world.

468
46:57.440 --> 46:59.599
You have your burdens to carry,

469
46:59.599 --> 47:01.460
and I have my own way to go.

470
47:01.460 --> 47:03.079
So now,

471
47:08.400 --> 47:10.860
I hope you can respect my choice.

472
47:17.460 --> 47:18.579
All right.

473
47:19.720 --> 47:23.840
I promised I wouldn't force you into anything again.

474
47:29.800 --> 47:31.573
I respect your choice.

475
47:44.960 --> 47:50.920
About your mother's death, I know all the evidence points to me.

476
47:52.820 --> 47:54.340
I won't make excuses.

477
47:55.760 --> 47:57.880
But please give me some time.

478
47:59.820 --> 48:03.960
I will give you and your mother

479
48:05.380 --> 48:06.880
an answer.
